      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had the hardest time figuring out that this is the line that actually will add the additional entries in wifiStats below. Can you add comments explaining that getUidStatsForTransport (through getNetworkStatsUidDetail) adds all operation counts to the stats with the active interface, and that interface is mobile, so this test makes sure that these operations are not surfaced in getUidStatsForTransport if the transport doesn\u0027t match them ?",
